    "title": "Starknet integrates with ShapeShift, cutting the bridge step from swaps",
    "summary": "The integration enhances Starknet's accessibility and could boost transaction volumes, fostering broader adoption and interoperability in DeFi.\nThe post Starknet integrates with ShapeShift, cutting the bridge step from swaps appeared first on Crypto Briefing.",
    "hasSummary": true,
