    "title": "Lagarde says euro-area economy is resilient, digital euro imminent",
    "summary": "“The digital euro will further stimulate innovation and competition in retail payments,” according to the ECB president.",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://cointelegraph.com/news/lagarde-says-euro-area-economy-is-resilient-digital-euro-imminent?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound",
